{"name":"Canadian Tuxedo","hex":"#579aca","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tuxedo","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A typically black formal jacket worn by men.","The entire suit complementing and including this jacket."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tuxedo"}],"entries":[{"title":"Jean jacket","blocks":[{"text":"A denim jacket, also called a jean jacket, jeans jacket or trucker jacket, is a jacket made from denim. Introduced in the United States in the late 19th century, it has been a popular type of casual apparel with both men and women and has been described as an iconic element of American fashion. Though a staple of western wear, the denim jacket has also enjoyed a more general appeal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg/330px-Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_jacket","wikidata":"Q48524668"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg/500px-Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg/1280px-Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg/500px-Riga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARiga-12_moped._Fortepan_6735.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Denim_Jacket_%2851079649933%29.jpg/500px-Denim_Jacket_%2851079649933%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wi